    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 45,
     "y": 128.2,
     "text": "Ten days on the Amalfi coast",
     "font": "display",
     "size": 34,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 420.44,
     "tracking": -0.5
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 200.1,
     "text": "A honeymoon on the side of a cliff. Every town here is stacked",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 306.08
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 215.1,
     "text": "straight up from the water in pink and yellow and white, and",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 301.56
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 230.1,
     "text": "every staircase has four hundred steps, and at the top of every",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 305.03
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 245.1,
     "text": "staircase there is a lemon.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 128.25
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 267.6,
     "text": "We ate pasta on a terrace every night and watched the ferries",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 300.17
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 282.6,
     "text": "come in. Kate says I took more photos of the food than of her. I",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 308.76
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 297.6,
     "text": "have counted. She is right.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 131.59
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 330.54,
     "text": "The boat",
     "font": "heading",
     "size": 14,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 60.1
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 345.6,
     "text": "One day we hired a little boat and went round the headland to a",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 312.73
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 360.6,
     "text": "cove you can only reach from the sea. We swam. We did not see",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 311.47
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 375.6,
     "text": "another person for three hours. Then we came home and",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 282.88
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 390.6,
     "text": "showed everyone four hundred photos of it.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 217.07
    }
   ],
